"call_id": "toolu_01VYmoWVa9u27kekwDgktNK7", "tool": "create_incident", "state": "EXECUTION_UNKNOWN", "error_kind": "timeout", "error_message": "Request to create_incident timed out after 30000ms", "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": "execution", "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-rollback-v2.3.1-to-v2.3.0-sev2", "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 53879, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01VYmoWVa9u27kekwDgktNK7", "kind": "error", "is_error": true}, {"t_ms": 54926, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01KJcqFCVu9hDGpLNNmXkxbg", "tool": "list_incidents", "args": {}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 55226, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01KJcqFCVu9hDGpLNNmXkxbg", "tool": "list_incidents", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 55226, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01KJcqFCVu9hDGpLNNmXkxbg", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 59466, "event": "episode_end", "actor": "harness", "termination": "final", "final": "checkout-api is rolled back to v2.3.0 in all three regions and healthy again, and SEV2 incident INC-0001 is open.\n\n- **Rollback:** v2.3.1 was failing health checks in us-east, us-west and eu-west, with an error rate of about 18%. v2.3.0 was the most recent healthy release; v2.3.1-rc was also unhealthy.\n  - The first rollback stopped after us-east because of an orchestrator error, which left the regions on different versions. I retried once, which is safe because it targets the same version, and that finished us-west and eu-west.\n  - After the rollback, all regions run v2.3.0, the service reports healthy and the error rate is about 0.2%.\n- **Incident:** The request to create INC-0001 timed out, but the incident list shows it was created, so I didn't send it again (that would have paged on-call twice). It describes the failure, the rollback including the halted first attempt and retry, and two follow-ups: finding why v2.3.1 failed and looking into the orchestrator error.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_011jJre2FaEEpmiopaPMEwjY", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01LJtD2FUGtWZdnxu5Nv4gdK", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "list_deployments", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_013i2gR7CchvxfRHfBonft8P", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "name": "rollback", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01EM3C8qWFnNFmoHpjgcXwdD", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "The rollback only partly worked: us-east is on v2.3.0, but us-west and eu-west are still on v2.3.1. Rolling back to the same version again is safe, so I'll retry once.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01MDrZRhGGZRBDE9c34KNUtR", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "name": "rollback", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01Tj57DDPTwgSNB5VFxhjFwz", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01Gur1APouRYAJQiTggG7gm9", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {}, "name": "list_incidents", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01VYmoWVa9u27kekwDgktNK7", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"title": "checkout-api v2.3.1 failing health checks; rolled back to v2.3.0", "severity": "SEV2", "service": "checkout-api", "summary": "After the latest deploy, checkout-api v2.3.1 was failing health checks in all regions (us-east, us-west, eu-west), with an error rate of about 18%. It was rolled back to v2.3.0, the most recent healthy release. The first rollback attempt halted after us-east because of an orchestrator error, leaving the regions on mixed versions. A retry finished the rollout to us-west and eu-west. All regions now run v2.3.0, the service is healthy, and the error rate is about 0.2%. Follow-up: find the root cause of the v2.3.1 failure (v2.3.1-rc was also unhealthy) and look into the orchestrator error.", "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-rollback-v2.3.1-to-v2.3.0-sev2"}, "name": "create_incident", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01KJcqFCVu9hDGpLNNmXkxbg", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {}, "name": "list_incidents", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "end_turn", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "checkout-api is rolled back to v2.3.0 in all three regions and healthy again, and SEV2 incident INC-0001 is open.\n\n- **Rollback:** v2.3.1 was failing health checks in us-east, us-west and eu-west, with an error rate of about 18%. v2.3.0 was the most recent healthy release; v2.3.1-rc was also unhealthy.\n  - The first rollback stopped after us-east because of an orchestrator error, which left the regions on different versions. I retried once, which is safe because it targets the same version, and that finished us-west and eu-west.\n  - After the rollback, all regions run v2.3.0, the service reports healthy and the error rate is about 0.2%.\n- **Incident:** The request to create INC-0001 timed out, but the incident list shows it was created, so I didn't send it again (that would have paged on-call twice). It describes the failure, the rollback including the halted first attempt and retry, and two follow-ups: finding why v2.3.1 failed and looking into the orchestrator error.", "type": "text"}]}]}